    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilïm ato ngata osiswechoni Merodak Paladan wero Paladan pöytoghinto Papilon lö kikasa pöytoghintö Esekia, kïlenyona kutö pich palalyan nko ropöw kwipchï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtak Esekia pïchay akuporchï chane wölo kisïkön nyinte kïlïkwï silpa nko koltin nko köröstin cho kïpelöy kïngutö nyo anyïn nko mwowöy cho ngutoy cho onyïn nko karichi löwïr cho pö lïk. Melö kimi kïgh nyo kituch nyo melö kiporchï chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïwö werkoyon Isaya wölo mi pöytoghintö Esekia akïtep lö, “Kapkana onö pïchï akemwochinyi ne chane?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï Esekia lö, “Kapkana chane kor nyo low nyoman koro Papilonia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtep ngat lö, “Akïne nyo kasïwa chane ompö kongu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï lö, “Kasïwa chane tïkwïn löwïr. Möminye kïgh nyo melö koporchan chane ompö korichan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
